{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-sun-earth-and-moon","version":1,"title":"Sun, Earth and Moon (a poem)","ageTiers":["7-8","9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"The Sun is a star that is far, far away.\nIt gives us the light and the warmth of day.","sentences":["The Sun is a star that is far, far away.","It gives us the light and the warmth of day."],"alt":"A bright sun over a village.","image":{"hash":"sha256:7e17647e6283456eb31ae193f82e2924b215aa619576a3dd52f379f951be6bc8","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:daabd91f8f5ecb17c10899503075fd3b7e036d0cf656a5ebf4cf00e42cc4486d","durationMs":11760,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6288],[6288,11760]],"words":[[0,410],[410,820],[820,1093],[1093,1366],[1366,1913],[1913,2460],[2460,2733],[2733,3827],[3827,4237],[4237,6288],[6288,6561],[6561,7245],[7245,7518],[7518,7928],[7928,8612],[8612,9022],[9022,9432],[9432,10252],[10252,10525],[10525,11760]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"The Earth is a ball that is turning round,\nonce in a day, without a sound.","sentences":["The Earth is a ball that is turning round,\nonce in a day, without a sound."],"alt":"A globe with a small arrow showing it turns.","image":{"hash":"sha256:2fd29cc8db328270defb0a5b0021a7c168057d780c815ff5e98afa9befd81c55","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:7d114655ee2b8fba7f0cdb0984f228daee79a413b51467bc87326623efaf3618","durationMs":13440,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,13440]],"words":[[0,538],[538,1434],[1434,1792],[1792,2150],[2150,2867],[2867,3584],[3584,3942],[3942,5196],[5196,6988],[6988,7705],[7705,8063],[8063,8421],[8421,9855],[9855,11109],[11109,11467],[11467,13440]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"When our side turns away, it is night.\nThe sky grows dark and the stars shine bright.","sentences":["When our side turns away, it is night.","The sky grows dark and the stars shine bright."],"alt":"A village at night 